You are an expert evaluator of conversational clustering systems. You will read a completed conversation between a simulated oracle and a clustering system, then score the session on the relevant dimensions.

---
GROUND TRUTH
Intent description: {{ intent_description }}

Intended operations (ordered):
{% for op in ground_truth_operations %}
{{ loop.index }}. {{ op.op }} — "{{ op.concept }}"
{% endfor %}

---
CONVERSATION TRANSCRIPT
{% for msg in transcript %}
{{ msg.role | upper }}: {{ msg.content }}
{% endfor %}

